% --- S20. Depreciating assets and trading stock (received file: Farmer, Mixed)
% Working [statute]: tractor: depreciating asset under Div 40, used wholly for
% a taxable purpose: disregarded (s 118-24(1)); fridge used partly privately:
% CGT event K7 applies instead, refused; stock: trading stock at the time of
