    tractor was acquired by rho on 2020-01-01.
    d1 has money proceeds of 30000.
    tractor has first element cost of 20000.
    d2 is a disposal of fridge by rho.
    d2 has contract date 2025-03-01.
    fridge was acquired by rho on 2020-01-01.
    d2 has money proceeds of 900.
    fridge has first element cost of 1200.
    d3 is a disposal of stock by rho.
    d3 has contract date 2025-03-01.
    stock was acquired by rho on 2024-09-01.
    stock is trading stock of rho at the time of d3.
    d3 has money proceeds of 5000.
    stock has first element cost of 4000.
    disregarded expects answers ["the capital gain or loss from d1 is disregarded because section 118-24 depreciating asset", "the capital gain or loss from d3 is disregarded because section 118-25 trading stock"].
    refused expects answers ["d2 is refused because CGT event K7 depreciating asset used for a non-taxable purpose not encoded"].
    cannot expects answers ["the net capital gain of rho for the income year 2025 cannot be worked out because refusal of one disposal in that income year"].
    net gain expects answers [].

% --- S21. Compensation, gambling, schemes (received file: Legal, Crypto) -----
% Working [statute]: settlement for a workplace injury: s 118-37(1)(a)(i);
% settlement for a relative's illness: s 118-37(1)(a)(ii); lottery win:
% s 118-37(1)(c); M4/M5 Cashback reimbursement: s 118-37(2)(d); a council
% rebate under a scheme established under an enactment: s 118-37(2)(a). All
