% --- S52. Twelve months across a leap day (TD 2002/10) ----------------------
% Working [statute via TD 2002/10]: acquired 2024-02-29: 12 months after is
% 2025-02-28 (last day of the month); an event on 2025-02-28 is not after it
% (no discount, 200), an event on 2025-03-01 is (100): year 2025 = 300.
% Acquired 2023-03-01: a clear year must contain 29 Feb 2024, so 366 whole
% days: an event on 2024-03-01 fails (200), on 2024-03-02 passes (100): year
% 2024 = 300.
