    d2 has money proceeds of 300.
    parcel q has first element cost of 100.
    d3 is a disposal of parcel r by b3.
    d3 has contract date 2024-03-01.
    parcel r was acquired by b3 on 2023-03-01.
    d3 has money proceeds of 300.
    parcel r has first element cost of 100.
    d4 is a disposal of parcel s by b3.
    d4 has contract date 2024-03-02.
    parcel s was acquired by b3 on 2023-03-01.
    d4 has money proceeds of 300.
    parcel s has first element cost of 100.
    discount expects answers ["d2 gives a discount capital gain", "d4 gives a discount capital gain"].
    net gain expects answers ["the net capital gain of b3 for the income year 2025 is 300.00", "the net capital gain of b3 for the income year 2024 is 300.00"].

