    parcel u was acquired by b5 on 2025-09-01.
    d2 has money proceeds of 2000.
    parcel u has first element cost of 1000.
    b5 has an unapplied net capital loss of 400 from the income year 2025.
    net gain expects answers ["the net capital gain of b5 for the income year 2025 is 1000.00", "the net capital gain of b5 for the income year 2026 is 600.00"].
    prior losses carried expects answers ["the prior year net capital losses of b5 that remain unapplied after 2025 are 0", "the prior year net capital losses of b5 that remain unapplied after 2026 are 0"].

% --- S55. No capital proceeds: market value taken to be received (s 116-30(1))
% Working [statute]: a gift at arm's length for nothing: proceeds = market
% value 5000; cost base 1000; gain 4000; held since 2015: discount; 2000. Then
% the same with no market value stated: cannot be assessed.
scenario s55 nil proceeds market value is:
    b6 is an entity of kind individual.
    d1 is a disposal of parcel v by b6.
    d1 has contract date 2025-03-01.
    parcel v was acquired by b6 on 2015-01-01.
    d1 has money proceeds of 0.
    parcel v had a market value of 5000 at the time of d1.
    parcel v has first element cost of 1000.
    proceeds expects answers ["the capital proceeds from d1 are 5000"].
    net gain expects answers ["the net capital gain of b6 for the income year 2025 is 2000.00"].

scenario s56 nil proceeds no market value is:
    b6 is an entity of kind individual.
    d1 is a disposal of parcel v by b6.
    d1 has contract date 2025-03-01.
    parcel v was acquired by b6 on 2015-01-01.
    d1 has money proceeds of 0.
    parcel v has first element cost of 1000.
    missing expects answers ["d1 cannot be assessed because the market value of the asset at the time of the disposal is missing"].
    net gain expects answers [].

% --- S57. A trust with a foreign residency period is refused (s 115-120) -----
scenario s57 trust foreign period refused is:
    b7 trust is an entity of kind trust.
    d1 is a disposal of parcel w by b7 trust.
    d1 has contract date 2025-03-01.
    parcel w was acquired by b7 trust on 2020-01-01.
    d1 has money proceeds of 2000.
    parcel w has first element cost of 1000.
    b7 trust was a foreign resident or temporary resident during part of the discount testing period of d1.
    b7 trust was an Australian resident for 500 of the days of the discount testing period of d1.
    refused expects answers ["d1 is refused because section 115-120 and trusts or superannuation entities with foreign or temporary residency not encoded"].
    net gain expects answers [].

% --- S58. Collectable acquired for no consideration: the $500 test uses the
% substituted first element (s 112-20, s 118-10(1)) ---------------------------
% Working [statute]: market value 400 when acquired is the first element; 400
% is 500 or less: the gain is disregarded. Net capital gain 0.
scenario s58 collectable no consideration is:
    b8 is an entity of kind individual.
    brooch is a collectable.
    d1 is a disposal of brooch by b8.
    d1 has contract date 2025-03-01.
    brooch was acquired by b8 on 2020-01-01.
    brooch was acquired for no consideration.
    brooch had a market value of 400 when acquired.
    d1 has money proceeds of 900.
    disregarded expects answers ["the capital gain or loss from d1 is disregarded because subsection 118-10(1) collectable with first element 500 or less"].
    net gain expects answers ["the net capital gain of b8 for the income year 2025 is 0"].

% --- S59. Land marked as a personal use asset: inputs conflict (s 108-20(3))
scenario s59 land as personal use asset refused is:
    b9 is an entity of kind individual.
    block one is a personal use asset.
    block one is land or a stratum unit or a building or structure that is a separate CGT asset under Subdivision 108-D.
    d1 is a disposal of block one by b9.
    d1 has contract date 2025-03-01.
    block one was acquired by b9 on 2020-01-01.
    d1 has money proceeds of 12000.
    block one has first element cost of 9000.
    refused expects answers ["d1 is refused because subsection 108-20(3) land or stratum unit or separate building cannot be a personal use asset"].
    disregarded expects answers [].
    net gain expects answers [].

query gain is:
    which disposal gives a capital gain of which amount.

query loss is:
    which disposal gives a capital loss of which amount.

query discount is:
    which disposal gives a discount capital gain.

query discount fail is:
    which disposal fails the discount test because which reason.

query disregarded is:
    the capital gain or loss from which disposal is disregarded because which reason.

query refused is:
    which disposal is refused because which reason.

query missing is:
    which disposal cannot be assessed because which fact is missing.

query net gain is:
    the net capital gain of which taxpayer for the income year which year is which amount.

query net loss is:
    the net capital loss of which taxpayer for the income year which year is which amount.

query cannot is:
    the net capital gain of which taxpayer for the income year which year cannot be worked out because which reason.

query collectable loss carried is:
    the net capital loss from collectables of which taxpayer for the income year which year is which amount.

query prior losses carried is:
    the prior year net capital losses of which taxpayer that remain unapplied after which year are which amount.

query cost base is:
    the cost base of which asset is which amount.

query reduced cost base is:
    the reduced cost base of which asset is which amount.

query proceeds is:
    the capital proceeds from which disposal are which amount.

query fraction is:
    the fraction of a discount capital gain from which disposal that remains after the discount is which number.
